  "name": "Community — MiniMax H3 (Turbo LoRA)",
  "version": "1.1.0",
  "author": "larryvrh",
  "description": "MiniMax H3 text-to-video with the v4-600 EMA Turbo LoRA + matching dual-schedule sampler from larryvrh/MiniMax-H3-Turbo-Lora — the default choice for 6-8 steps and for any motion that is not heavy/fast, while keeping audio in sync. The current best line improves static/small-motion detail and resolves the v1 over-sharpened plastic look. Training continues, and audio plus fast-motion behaviour remain open areas, so treat this as a preview. Same base MiniMax H3 checkpoint/text-encoder/VAE as SimpliGen's official MiniMax H3 pack, so no extra large downloads beyond the ~744MB LoRA.",
